                "description": "Victorian Amber Knob With Radius Rose Fusion 17-B2 - Pictures do not do this amber knob justice--for it is beautiful, sparkling in the old world grandeur. The knob itself is made out of glass while the radius rose is created out of solid brass. Available in 6 finishes,  this Victorian Amber Knob is a great way to add old world allure to any home. It is available in either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset; and will adjust to door thicknesses from 1-1/4 inches to 2 inches.",
